  "nonoBio": "Nono is the big brother. He has dark curly hair, a huge grin, and endless energy. He never walks, he always runs! He loves football and races, and he's always the first to shout an answer. Sometimes he rushes and gets it wrong, but he laughs, tries again, and never gives up. He loves his little brother and is always cheering him on.",
  "fofoBio": "Fofo is the little brother. He has caramel curls and a missing front tooth. He's calm and clever, and when he's thinking he puts a finger on his chin. He loves puzzles and drawing, and asks \"why?\" about everything. He takes his time, but when he answers he's usually right, and he spots little things nobody else notices.",
  "together": "Nono brings the courage, Fofo brings the ideas, and together no letter can hide from them!",
  "ourStory": "Our story",
  "storyHome": "Nono and Fofo are two Egyptian brothers who live with Mom and Dad in Cairo. Every Friday they visit Grandpa's house, the best place in the world, full of old books and stories.",
