  "storyGrandpa": "Grandpa is kind and calm, and he knows lots of stories. He has a very old Coptic book whose letters shine like gold.",
  "lostLetters": "The lost letters",
  "storyAdventure": "One day, Nono ran into Grandpa's house as usual… and crashed right into the book! It fell open, and the letters flew out and scattered all over Egypt: along the Nile, into the village, to the Pyramids, the desert monastery, and all the way to Alexandria by the sea. Ever since, Nono and Fofo have been travelling across Egypt to find the letters and bring them back to the book.",
